          <p>
            If you are still choosing between brands rather than between SX5000 versions, the <a href="/best-penetrating-concrete-sealer/">penetrating concrete sealer guide</a> compares SX5000 with its competitors. For pool decks specifically, our <a href="/best-pool-deck-sealer/">pool deck sealer guide</a> covers the slip-resistance question that a silane-siloxane avoids by adding no film.
